<x-layout title="Company settings"><x-page-header title="Company settings" eyebrow="Administration" description="Workspace preferences and the small public-intake settings." /><a href="{{ route('settings.ai') }}" class="btn btn-secondary mb-6">Extraction & AI settings</a><form method="POST" action="{{ route('settings.update') }}" class="panel panel-pad max-w-4xl space-y-8">@csrf @method('PATCH')<section><h2 class="section-title">Workspace preferences</h2><div class="mt-6 space-y-6"><x-field name="display_name" label="Company display name" :value="$settings->display_name" required maxlength="255" /><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><x-field name="timezone" label="Default display timezone" :value="$settings->timezone" required list="timezones" hint="IANA timezone. Timestamps are stored in UTC." /><datalist id="timezones">@foreach(timezone_identifiers_list() as $zone)<option value="{{ $zone }}">@endforeach</datalist><x-field name="currency" type="select" label="Preferred display currency" required>@foreach(['MYR','USD','SGD','EUR','GBP','CNY','JPY','AUD','THB','IDR'] as $currency)<option @selected(old('currency',$settings->currency)===$currency)>{{ $currency }}</option>@endforeach</x-field></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-8"><h2 class="section-title">Vendor RFQ reply & signature</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500">Use approved company details. These are an intended reply contact and signature; no transport sender is connected or verified. Existing approved requests keep their frozen content.</p><div class="mt-6 space-y-6"><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><x-field name="rfq_reply_name" label="Company reply name" :value="$settings->rfq_reply_name" maxlength="255" /><x-field name="rfq_reply_email" label="Company reply email" type="email" :value="$settings->rfq_reply_email" maxlength="254" /></div><x-field name="rfq_signature" label="Approved RFQ signature" type="textarea" :value="$settings->rfq_signature" maxlength="3000" hint="Real company/team contact details only. No invented credentials, partnerships or guaranteed dates." /></div></section><section class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-8"><h2 class="section-title">Customer inquiry page</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500">Approve company identity, services, contacts and privacy wording before launch. No credentials, endorsements or legal compliance claims are assumed.</p><div class="mt-6 space-y-6"><input type="hidden" name="public_intake_enabled" value="0"><label class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm"><input class="h-4 w-4 accent-accent" type="checkbox" name="public_intake_enabled" value="1" @checked(old('public_intake_enabled',$settings->public_intake_enabled))>Accept public inquiries</label><x-field name="public_service_intro" label="Public service introduction" type="textarea" :value="$settings->public_service_intro" required maxlength="2000" /><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><x-field name="public_contact_email" label="Public contact email" type="email" :value="$settings->public_contact_email" maxlength="254" /><x-field name="public_contact_phone" label="Public contact phone" :value="$settings->public_contact_phone" maxlength="64" /></div><x-field name="public_contact_address" label="Public company address" type="textarea" :value="$settings->public_contact_address" maxlength="2000" /><x-field name="public_intake_owner_id" label="Default intake owner" type="select" hint="No active default means a visible unassigned inquiry. No response deadline is assumed."><option value="">Unassigned · staff will assign</option>@foreach($owners as $owner)<option value="{{ $owner->id }}" @selected(old('public_intake_owner_id',$settings->public_intake_owner_id)==$owner->id)>{{ $owner->name }}</option>@endforeach</x-field><x-field name="public_privacy_notice" label="Privacy notice" type="textarea" :value="$settings->public_privacy_notice" required maxlength="6000" /><x-field name="public_privacy_version" label="Privacy notice version" :value="$settings->public_privacy_version" required maxlength="64" hint="Change the version when editing wording. Original submissions retain the exact notice and acknowledgment." /></div></section><section class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-8"><h2 class="section-title">Approved receipt & mailbox confirmation</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500">The only automatic customer email in Phase 3A. A configured transactional transport is also required. Log/array/fallback transports are never treated as external delivery.</p><div class="mt-6 space-y-6"><input type="hidden" name="receipt_mail_enabled" value="0"><label class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm"><input class="h-4 w-4 accent-accent" type="checkbox" name="receipt_mail_enabled" value="1" @checked(old('receipt_mail_enabled',$settings->receipt_mail_enabled))>Enable the approved receipt email</label><x-field name="receipt_mail_body" label="Approved fixed receipt wording" type="textarea" :value="$settings->receipt_mail_body" required maxlength="2000" hint="Plain text, no shipment fields or promises. The case reference and confirmation action are added automatically." /><p class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-5 text-xs leading-6">{{ \App\Support\PublicIntake::transportAvailable($settings)?'Explicit transport configuration is available; the queue worker must run.':'Receipt transport is disabled or unavailable. Inquiries are still accepted; nothing is externally sent.' }}</p></div></section><div class="flex justify-end"><x-button>Save settings</x-button></div></form></x-layout>
